WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.930
It was raining.

00:03.050 --> 00:07.690
That tells us. But can you hear it? Can you smell it?

00:07.810 --> 00:13.900
Your five senses help you show it: see, hear, feel, smell and taste.

00:14.020 --> 00:17.880
What could you hear? Rain drummed on the roof.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.340
What could you smell? The air smelled like wet dirt.

00:22.460 --> 00:24.920
Now we're right there with you.

00:25.040 --> 00:31.147
So when you write, ask: what would I see, hear, feel, smell or taste?
